\author{hakongylterud}
\author{fredrikbakke}
\title{Towards the representation theorem for polynomial endofunctors}
\import{stt-macros}
\meta{source}{\PR{165}}

\p{
During the workshop, [[hakongylterud]] worked on formalising the representation
theorem for [polynomial endofunctors](Wild.PolynomialEndofunctors)/containers, using
the parametricity property of [the category of spaces](Synthetic.Categories.Spaces)
#{\SS}.
}

\subtree{
\title{Representation theorem for polynomial endofunctors}
\taxon{Theorem}
\p{
Between #{\SS}-valued polynomial endofunctors, morphisms and natural transformations
coincide.
}
}

\p{
In support of this project we merged some of [[fredrikbakke]]'s work on polynomial
endofunctors done prior to the meeting. We hope to resume this project in the future.
}

\subtree{
\title{New modules}

\ul{
